    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The petitioner is in judicial custody in connection with Valmikinagar P.S. Case No.111 of 2022 instituted under Sections 376, 341, 323, 504, 506, 34 of the IPC and under Section 6 and 12 of POCSO Act lodged on 10.11.2022 by the informant Jiwati Kumari.\nAs per the prosecution story, the girl has alleged that she along with her fiance had gone for eye check up and while her would be husband had gone to attend the nature's call, the accused persons came, abused and later allegation is that immoral act was done by them which was also video shoot.\nAs the accuseds were again passing through the forest area, the locals caught hold of the petitioner and this way, he was taken into custody.\nPatna High Court CR. MISC. No.28354 of 2023(3) dt.18-08-2023 The kind of allegation that has come against the petitioner, for the present, this Court is not inclined to grant him privilege of bail which is accordingly rejected.\n (Rajiv Roy, J)\nTaj Mohammad @ Taj Dewan vs The State Of Bihar on 18 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/156275426/\n1",
